    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_TemplateName">Template name</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_TemplateHtmlHelp">You can use HTML in the template. Playnite renders tags such as &amp;lt;p&amp;gt;, &amp;lt;h3&amp;gt;, &amp;lt;ul&amp;gt;, &amp;lt;li&amp;gt; and &amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;, so the description does not appear crammed together.</sys:String>
