{0}</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_ErrorMalformedAiJson">The AI returned a response with an invalid format and it could not be interpreted.

The plugin will continue with the rest of the games. You can retry this game, reduce text length, or switch to a model that follows JSON more reliably.

Brief detail: </sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_ErrorMediaProviderNotConfigured">Metadata AI media is not configured. Open the plugin settings and configure at least one usable media source.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_ErrorMediaWithoutUrl">The media source returned an image without a usable URL.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_ErrorMetadataProviderNotConfigured">Metadata AI is not configured. Open the plugin settings and set endpoint, model and API key.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_ErrorNoImagesFound">No images were found for this game in the configured media sources.</sys:String>
